WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:51.691 --> 00:01:53.989
My hand's asleep...

00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:02.167
Good morning, Tenchi.

00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:11.111
R-Ryoko! What the heck
are you doing in my bed?!

00:02:11.111 --> 00:02:14.514
Now, it's only natural for two people in love...

00:02:14.514 --> 00:02:17.050
...to share the same bed.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.618
That's not what I meant!

00:02:18.618 --> 00:02:22.189
You're supposed to be in Okayama!
What are you doing here?!

00:02:22.189 --> 00:02:23.757
Oh, that.

00:02:23.757 --> 00:02:25.392
Yeah, that.

00:02:25.392 --> 00:02:27.053
See?

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:31.798
Breakfast time!

00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:34.028
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:02:37.237 --> 00:02:38.438
All right, everyone!

00:02:38.438 --> 00:02:40.040
Good morning!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.009
- Good morning...
- Let's eat!

00:02:43.009 --> 00:02:45.812
Mihoshi? Could you
please pass me the soy sauce?

00:02:45.812 --> 00:02:47.113
Sure!

00:02:47.113 --> 00:02:49.616
Careful! You're spilling it!

00:02:49.616 --> 00:02:51.084
Get a rag! Get a rag!

00:02:51.084 --> 00:02:52.752
These pickled radishes are delicious!

00:02:52.752 --> 00:02:54.087
They sure are, aren't they?

00:02:54.087 --> 00:02:56.056
Oh, right, Tenchi.

00:02:56.056 --> 00:02:59.793
I've fixed this end of the
Dimension Tunnel inside your comforter.

00:02:59.793 --> 00:03:02.028
I hope you don't mind.

00:03:02.028 --> 00:03:07.234
Come on, Tenchi! The <i>miso</i> soup
has tofu and potato in it today!

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:08.835
Sit by me, Tenchi!

00:03:08.835 --> 00:03:10.904
No, sit by me, Lord Tenchi!

00:03:10.904 --> 00:03:12.565
Over here!

00:03:16.176 --> 00:03:20.013
Let's not resort to violence, all right, Ryoko?

00:03:20.013 --> 00:03:24.279
What? I asked him first!

00:03:26.186 --> 00:03:27.787
Cut it out, okay?

00:03:27.787 --> 00:03:31.091
This is just like things were back in Okayama.

00:03:31.091 --> 00:03:34.458
- Just a moment, Lord Tenchi.
- Hold on, Tenchi.

00:03:36.596 --> 00:03:39.533
It certainly is peaceful today, isn't it?

00:03:39.533 --> 00:03:43.128
And silence is surely golden...

00:03:44.304 --> 00:03:46.238
It's standing on end!

00:03:50.377 --> 00:03:52.646
Clean up that mess! Got it?

00:03:52.646 --> 00:03:55.215
Take out the garbage, okay?

00:03:55.215 --> 00:03:56.705
Geez.

00:04:05.859 --> 00:04:07.349
"Dead Silence"

00:04:09.195 --> 00:04:13.097
It sure is quiet here without Tenchi around.

00:04:16.303 --> 00:04:19.072
Look at this! <i>"Wanted:</i> Actor to
play evil alien in live stage show.

00:04:19.072 --> 00:04:21.675
970 yen an hour."

00:04:21.675 --> 00:04:24.177
Salaries really are higher in Tokyo!

00:04:24.177 --> 00:04:26.513
Are you saying that you
know what that job's for?

00:04:26.513 --> 00:04:28.214
Nope!

00:04:28.214 --> 00:04:32.218
Oh, Tenchi... I wonder if he's hurt?

00:04:32.218 --> 00:04:34.487
Maybe he's caught
something from unboiled water...

00:04:34.487 --> 00:04:37.157
Maybe he's lost somewhere...

00:04:37.157 --> 00:04:39.893
Sounds to me like somebody's too
big a worry-wart for her own good.

00:04:39.893 --> 00:04:41.194
What?!

00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:45.130
Oh, Tenchi... I wonder if
he's been run over by a car?

00:04:46.066 --> 00:04:49.002
Or maybe he's gotten
hooked on dangerous pastimes!

00:04:49.002 --> 00:04:50.971
No!

00:04:50.971 --> 00:04:53.473
Or maybe he's been seduced
by some wicked woman!

00:04:53.473 --> 00:04:55.375
Lord Tenchi's not that sort of man!

00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:57.444
Oh, so the wicked woman was here all along.

00:04:57.444 --> 00:04:59.012
That does it!

00:04:59.012 --> 00:05:00.980
You wanna piece of me?

00:05:01.815 --> 00:05:04.217
What are you doing with that, Washu?

00:05:04.217 --> 00:05:07.420
You looking for a vacation spot with that?

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:10.457
Since the exit of the
Dimension Tunnel has been set,

00:05:10.457 --> 00:05:13.059
I thought I'd set the entrance, too.

00:05:13.059 --> 00:05:15.161
Oh, so that's the entrance, huh?

00:05:15.161 --> 00:05:15.762
Right.

00:05:15.762 --> 00:05:17.764
Really?

00:05:17.764 --> 00:05:19.966
Oh, wow!

00:05:19.966 --> 00:05:21.134
You're right!

00:05:21.134 --> 00:05:22.268
Yep.

00:05:22.268 --> 00:05:23.970
If I put that in my room,

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.574
I could go see Tenchi
without anyone bothering us!

00:05:27.574 --> 00:05:32.078
If I had that thing, I could go
see Tenchi, and nobody'd bother us!

00:05:32.078 --> 00:05:35.248
Washu? Would you do me a favor?

00:05:35.248 --> 00:05:37.083
Look, Washu. It's like this...

00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:37.784
Yeah?

00:05:37.784 --> 00:05:43.490
- Could I put it in my room?
- Put the entrance in my room, okay?

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:44.724
- What?!
- What?!

00:05:44.724 --> 00:05:46.893
- Uh... Hey.
- You want it in your room so you can...

00:05:46.893 --> 00:05:49.429
...go see Tenchi whenever you want!

00:05:49.429 --> 00:05:49.996
- You want it so you can...

00:05:49.996 --> 00:05:52.632
- Hello?
- You want it so you can...

00:05:52.632 --> 00:05:55.168
- Give that back.
<i>...go</i> see him by yourself!

00:05:55.168 --> 00:05:56.102
Oh, dear...

00:05:56.102 --> 00:05:59.072
Here we go again.

00:05:59.072 --> 00:06:00.240
You won't get away with this!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.674
That's my line!

00:06:07.447 --> 00:06:10.211
I'm starving! What're you gonna have today?

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:21.027
I can't believe the difference in
the building and the menu here.

00:06:21.027 --> 00:06:23.257
That's Tokyo for you.

00:06:24.164 --> 00:06:27.834
Hey, Masaki. You getting
used to things here yet?

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:31.371
If you run into any
problems, just let us know.

00:06:31.371 --> 00:06:33.873
Thanks. Uh...

00:06:33.873 --> 00:06:36.976
Umanosuke Tsuchida. I'm in your class.

00:06:36.976 --> 00:06:40.747
My grandpa tells me
you're training at our shrine.

00:06:40.747 --> 00:06:44.150
Oh, so you're Dokuzen Tsuchida's grandson!

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.452
Pleased to meet you!

00:06:45.452 --> 00:06:47.887
And I'm Kazuhiko Amagasaki.

00:06:47.887 --> 00:06:49.255
Move over, would you?

00:06:49.255 --> 00:06:51.223
What?

00:06:52.225 --> 00:06:54.090
Could'ja move?

00:06:55.762 --> 00:06:56.563
You're...

00:06:56.563 --> 00:06:57.931
Kumashiro!

00:06:57.931 --> 00:06:59.833
Sakuya.

00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:02.001
Do you mind?

00:07:02.001 --> 00:07:03.803
All right, all right...

00:07:03.803 --> 00:07:05.293
Thanks.

00:07:07.874 --> 00:07:10.934
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:07:16.983 --> 00:07:18.251
What is this guy?

00:07:18.251 --> 00:07:22.689
Sakuya Kumashiro, <i>#3</i> on
Tenmangu High's "Must-Have" list...

00:07:22.689 --> 00:07:24.953
How come she's after this guy?

00:07:46.179 --> 00:07:47.747
Leggo, already!

00:07:47.747 --> 00:07:49.916
You let go!

00:07:49.916 --> 00:07:53.019
Hey! If you pull it like that, you'll break it!

00:07:53.019 --> 00:07:54.988
What're you two doing?

00:07:54.988 --> 00:07:57.290
They're fighting over the
Dimension Tunnel entrance.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.026
Come on, you two! Stop it!

00:08:00.026 --> 00:08:01.494
Let go!

00:08:01.494 --> 00:08:03.724
You let go!

00:08:17.744 --> 00:08:19.245
Oh, dear.

00:08:19.245 --> 00:08:20.580
Oh, no!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.615
Can't you take it down and
reattach it somewhere else?

00:08:22.615 --> 00:08:25.218
The entrance and exit are both fixed now.

00:08:25.218 --> 00:08:28.888
I'd have to redo all
the settings from scratch.

00:08:28.888 --> 00:08:31.491
Hey, I don't mind this at all!

00:08:31.491 --> 00:08:33.459
Hey! Ryoko!

00:08:33.459 --> 00:08:37.293
I'll go see if the tunnel's hooked up okay.

00:08:38.298 --> 00:08:42.132
Come back here, Ryoko!
Come back here, I said!

00:08:55.048 --> 00:08:56.683
Masaki?

00:08:56.683 --> 00:08:58.418
Oh, hi, Kumashiro.

00:08:58.418 --> 00:08:59.986
Call me Sakuya.

00:08:59.986 --> 00:09:01.054
Okay. Uh, Sakuya.

00:09:01.054 --> 00:09:03.022
Let's head back together.

00:09:07.293 --> 00:09:09.062
What is it with that guy?

00:09:09.062 --> 00:09:11.030
I can't believe it!

00:09:22.041 --> 00:09:25.378
So where do you live, Masaki?

00:09:25.378 --> 00:09:28.541
That apartment building over th...

00:09:33.553 --> 00:09:34.420
What's wrong?

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.355
Uh, n-nothing.

00:09:35.355 --> 00:09:36.322
Oh!

00:09:36.322 --> 00:09:38.290
It's Tenchi!

00:09:39.592 --> 00:09:41.227
Who's that girl?

00:09:41.227 --> 00:09:43.062
I don't like the looks of this.

00:09:43.062 --> 00:09:45.622
Don't worry about it...
Don't worry about it...

00:09:51.638 --> 00:09:53.273
Tenchi, you two-timer!

00:09:53.273 --> 00:09:57.877
I won't forgive this, Lord Tenchi!
Not while you have someone like me!

00:09:57.877 --> 00:09:58.544
Thanks.

00:09:58.544 --> 00:10:00.876
Uh, are you okay?

00:10:04.617 --> 00:10:05.485
This isn't good...

00:10:05.485 --> 00:10:09.989
If I let Ryoko and Ayeka
meet Sakuya, it's gonna get ugly!

00:10:09.989 --> 00:10:11.824
Sakuya! This way!

00:10:11.824 --> 00:10:14.594
- Huh?
- He's getting away! Let's go after him, Ayeka!

00:10:14.594 --> 00:10:16.721
Of course!

00:10:22.735 --> 00:10:25.038
I think we'll be okay now.

00:10:25.038 --> 00:10:27.006
Huh? What is this place?

00:10:27.006 --> 00:10:29.770
A famous wedding shrine.

00:10:33.012 --> 00:10:37.083
I don't suppose you brought me
here on purpose, did you, Masaki?

00:10:37.083 --> 00:10:39.252
No, you've got it all wrong!
It's just a coincidence!

00:10:39.252 --> 00:10:41.686
Either way's okay with me, I guess.

00:10:42.989 --> 00:10:45.253
Uh. Right.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:56.032
O marriage goddess...

00:10:58.371 --> 00:11:01.932
Please act as matchmaker for me and Masaki.

00:11:05.044 --> 00:11:08.275
I have heard thy prayer!

00:11:16.422 --> 00:11:18.185
Wh-Who's there?

00:11:19.959 --> 00:11:22.655
In matters of the heart...

00:11:26.933 --> 00:11:30.336
...just leave everything to me!

00:11:30.336 --> 00:11:32.005
Wh-Who are you?

00:11:32.005 --> 00:11:34.907
I am the goddess of marriage!

00:11:34.907 --> 00:11:36.932
Ine Suzuki!

00:11:53.259 --> 00:11:56.062
Fair maiden who hath sought my aid,

00:11:56.062 --> 00:11:58.364
if you leave everything in
my hands, all will go well!

00:11:58.364 --> 00:12:00.333
Everything will be lovey-dovey!

00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:01.401
Really?

00:12:01.401 --> 00:12:04.037
True as true can get!

00:12:04.037 --> 00:12:05.071
Great!

00:12:05.071 --> 00:12:06.672
Who's this?

00:12:06.672 --> 00:12:09.042
The goddess of marriage. Right?

00:12:09.042 --> 00:12:12.412
That's right! I'm the goddess of marriage!

00:12:12.412 --> 00:12:16.382
Just watch my power!

00:12:16.382 --> 00:12:21.154
So, where's the hot
spot for dates these days?

00:12:21.154 --> 00:12:22.588
Tenchi!

00:12:22.588 --> 00:12:24.690
Lord Tenchi!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.493
Ryoko! Ayeka!

00:12:27.493 --> 00:12:29.829
I won't put up with any interference!

00:12:29.829 --> 00:12:31.763
Watch this!

00:12:37.603 --> 00:12:42.768
That's strange. I could have
sworn I heard Tenchi's voice.

00:12:46.045 --> 00:12:48.614
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:12:48.614 --> 00:12:50.149
Anyway, let's look for him.

00:12:50.149 --> 00:12:52.049
Yes, let's.

00:12:57.056 --> 00:12:59.183
Take your time, now.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.485
I'll leave you two alone.

00:13:12.505 --> 00:13:15.408
Isn't this romantic?

00:13:15.408 --> 00:13:17.774
Uh... Yeah.

00:13:23.683 --> 00:13:25.583
This is great...

00:13:32.058 --> 00:13:34.560
This is the red thread of fate!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.663
Two people who are
bound by it will fall in love...

00:13:37.663 --> 00:13:40.666
...and return each other's love!

00:13:40.666 --> 00:13:42.902
What're you doing down there?

00:13:42.902 --> 00:13:45.004
Would you look at all the dust around here?

00:13:45.004 --> 00:13:47.206
All right, then, on to our next stop!

00:13:47.206 --> 00:13:49.709
Lord Tenchi! Lord Tenchi?

00:13:49.709 --> 00:13:52.143
Tenchi! Where are you?

00:14:06.125 --> 00:14:07.854
All right, then...

00:14:13.799 --> 00:14:17.370
And now, they're in love!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.099
I did it!

00:14:20.406 --> 00:14:21.207
Huh?

00:14:21.207 --> 00:14:23.732
I almost had it!

00:14:46.165 --> 00:14:50.703
Well? Are you two making
with the lovey-dovey yet?

00:14:50.703 --> 00:14:53.570
Well, I am, anyway...

00:14:57.076 --> 00:15:01.314
Very well. No more kid gloves.

00:15:01.314 --> 00:15:04.584
I'll take you to someplace special.

00:15:04.584 --> 00:15:05.785
Come on!

00:15:05.785 --> 00:15:06.686
H-Hey!

00:15:06.686 --> 00:15:08.153
Here we go!

00:15:12.592 --> 00:15:15.527
All right, open your eyes!

00:15:19.398 --> 00:15:20.797
Where are we?

00:15:23.236 --> 00:15:25.271
This is the hill of legend!

00:15:25.271 --> 00:15:27.473
If you profess your love beneath that tree,

00:15:27.473 --> 00:15:30.643
you'll be bound together forever!

00:15:30.643 --> 00:15:33.512
Wow, I didn't know we had
a place like this in Shibuya...

00:15:33.512 --> 00:15:36.015
Let's go take a look, Masaki!

00:15:36.015 --> 00:15:37.983
H-Hey! Wait a minute!

00:15:45.358 --> 00:15:48.928
Come on, Masaki, tell me you love me.

00:15:48.928 --> 00:15:51.430
Huh? But I...

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.199
Masaki!

00:15:53.199 --> 00:15:57.603
I'm sorry, Sakuya, but I can't say that yet.

00:15:57.603 --> 00:15:57.770
"Shock"
I'm sorry, Sakuya, but I can't say that yet.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.206
"Shock"
- What?!
- Th-Then you hate me?

00:16:00.206 --> 00:16:00.873
- What?!
- Th-Then you hate me?

00:16:00.873 --> 00:16:04.810
No, I... I don't hate you!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:10.749
But we just met! I can't say
that I love you or hate you yet!

00:16:12.285 --> 00:16:13.619
It's done!

00:16:13.619 --> 00:16:17.623
The thread of fate is tied!

00:16:17.623 --> 00:16:22.595
You're now destined to fall in love!

00:16:22.595 --> 00:16:23.763
Really?!

00:16:23.763 --> 00:16:25.331
Really.

00:16:25.331 --> 00:16:29.902
And now, share a passionate
kiss beneath the tree of destiny!

00:16:29.902 --> 00:16:33.303
That will make your love eternal!

00:16:35.508 --> 00:16:36.876
Really?

00:16:36.876 --> 00:16:38.878
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:16:38.878 --> 00:16:41.244
No more waiting!

00:16:49.088 --> 00:16:50.456
H-Hey!

00:16:50.456 --> 00:16:53.254
Now, hold on here!

00:16:56.796 --> 00:16:57.797
No!

00:16:57.797 --> 00:17:01.233
I can't do it! I'm just not ready!

00:17:01.233 --> 00:17:04.470
What are you saying?
This is what you wished for, isn't it?

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:08.240
It's only natural for
two people in love to kiss!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.711
I'm not arguing with that!
I just don't want to force him!

00:17:11.711 --> 00:17:13.346
Oh, be quiet!

00:17:13.346 --> 00:17:16.838
It doesn't matter if it's
forced or not! A kiss is still a kiss!

00:17:21.954 --> 00:17:23.615
Sakuya!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:31.063
Don't! Stop it, Sakuya!

00:17:31.063 --> 00:17:34.100
That'll be enough resistance
out of you, young man!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.702
See? The thread of
fate is tied nice and tight...

00:17:36.702 --> 00:17:39.972
...around the little finger of your left hand!

00:17:39.972 --> 00:17:41.807
Huh?

00:17:41.807 --> 00:17:44.367
What are all these?

00:17:53.386 --> 00:17:55.479
Where'd this thread come from?

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.221
Oh, my.

00:18:06.165 --> 00:18:11.159
I just don't understand this!

00:18:15.341 --> 00:18:17.410
What the?

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.811
We finally found you, Tenchi!

00:18:18.811 --> 00:18:19.845
Lord Tenchi!

00:18:19.845 --> 00:18:21.247
Ryoko! Ayeka!

00:18:21.247 --> 00:18:23.115
Wh-Who are you?

00:18:23.115 --> 00:18:25.284
That's my line!

00:18:25.284 --> 00:18:28.220
First I see this red string
around my little finger,

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.823
and then I get dragged into wherever this is!

00:18:30.823 --> 00:18:33.559
You don't seem to be an ordinary human.

00:18:33.559 --> 00:18:35.194
Let Tenchi go!

00:18:35.194 --> 00:18:39.927
I won't let anyone interfere with my work!

00:18:43.903 --> 00:18:47.039
Wh-What's the big idea?!

00:18:47.039 --> 00:18:49.337
Take this!

00:18:54.447 --> 00:18:57.650
Keep rolling like that for the
rest of your lives for all I care!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.483
Oh, you've gotta be kidding me, you little...

00:19:03.088 --> 00:19:05.991
I won't let you have your way with him!

00:19:05.991 --> 00:19:08.084
Why, you...

00:19:17.603 --> 00:19:19.405
Spool, thread, spool! Spool, spool, spool!

00:19:19.405 --> 00:19:22.741
Wind it, wind it! Boom boom boom!

00:19:22.741 --> 00:19:24.210
Why, you!

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:26.045
Spool, thread, spool! Spool, spool, spool!

00:19:26.045 --> 00:19:28.113
Wind it, wind it! Boom boom boom!

00:19:28.113 --> 00:19:30.916
D-Damn you!

00:19:30.916 --> 00:19:32.451
We're just gettin' warmed up!

00:19:32.451 --> 00:19:34.920
Take this! And this!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:37.218
Hey, hey, hey!!

00:19:38.057 --> 00:19:41.117
Hey, hey, hey!

00:19:41.794 --> 00:19:43.318
Oops.

00:20:07.586 --> 00:20:11.488
I've had it up to here with matchmaking!

00:20:25.404 --> 00:20:28.669
Kumashiro? Kumashiro!

00:20:29.775 --> 00:20:32.678
Wh-Where am I?

00:20:32.678 --> 00:20:34.847
Where's the marriage goddess?

00:20:34.847 --> 00:20:36.749
Marriage goddess?

00:20:36.749 --> 00:20:38.979
You sure you weren't dreaming?

00:20:40.319 --> 00:20:41.787
Maybe...

00:20:41.787 --> 00:20:44.690
Come on. Let's go.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:48.494
I always knew I was the
one who's bound to Tenchi!

00:20:48.494 --> 00:20:54.166
Oh, Lord Tenchi... You and
I are bound by the threads of fate.

00:20:54.166 --> 00:20:55.601
See you, Masaki!

00:20:55.601 --> 00:20:57.262
See you tomorrow!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.639
Okay! Bye!

00:21:00.639 --> 00:21:04.777
Looks like that girl's
sinking her claws into Tenchi!

00:21:04.777 --> 00:21:07.644
You're right. We need to check her out.

00:21:08.681 --> 00:21:10.581
Check...

00:21:36.375 --> 00:21:39.979
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.979 --> 00:21:43.882
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.882 --> 00:21:47.486
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.486 --> 00:21:51.423
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.423 --> 00:21:54.927
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.927 --> 00:21:58.897
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.897 --> 00:22:02.234
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.234 --> 00:22:06.238
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.238 --> 00:22:08.374
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.374 --> 00:22:10.309
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.309 --> 00:22:11.810
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:17.650
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:21.754
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.754 --> 00:22:25.024
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:25.024 --> 00:22:28.560
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:33.259
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:45.711 --> 00:22:48.247
My name is Ayeka.

00:22:48.247 --> 00:22:50.549
Ryoko did something foolish,

00:22:50.549 --> 00:22:54.319
and now Tenchi doesn't want
us to come to Tokyo anymore.

00:22:54.319 --> 00:22:56.722
So we're going to ask
Washu to invent something

00:22:56.722 --> 00:23:00.225
that will at least let us see what he's up to!

00:23:00.225 --> 00:23:03.888
I, Ayeka, feel something of a stalker.

00:23:05.197 --> 00:23:10.430
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Long Distance Lunacy."
